<title>USA: Mallon adopts shareholders rights plan.</title>
<headline>Mallon adopts shareholders rights plan.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mallon Resources Corp said Friday it had adopted a shareholders rights plan but knew of no current or threatened takeover attempt.</p>
<p>Mallon said its plan will protect shareholder interests if the company should face &quot;coercive or unfair takeover tactics.&quot;</p>
<p>The plan would become effective if a person or group acquired 20 percent or more of Mallon's common shares.</p>
<p>Mallon is an oil and natural gas exploration and production company operating primarily in New Mexico. Its shares were unchanged at 7-1/8.</p>
</text>
